  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "A three-person startup pays Google about a hundred and eighty dollars a month.",
      "scene": "receipt",
      "section": "01 - the bill",
      "hl": [
        "hundred",
        "eighty"
      ],
      "mood": "neutral",
      "tally": 180
    },
    {
      "text": "In forty-eight hours, their bill hit eighty-two thousand.",
      "scene": "bignum",
      "section": "01 - the bill",
      "hl": [
        "eighty-two",
        "thousand"
      ],
      "mood": "shocked",
      "gesture": "hands",
      "tally": 82314
    },
    {
      "text": "Your app can do the same, and one prompt stops it. I'll give it to you at the end.",
      "scene": "prompt_locked",
      "section": "01 - the bill",
      "hl": [
        "prompt",
        "end"
      ],
      "mood": "smirk",
      "gesture": "point"
    },
    {
      "text": "It starts with a key that begins with A, I, Z, A.",
      "scene": "code_key",
      "section": "02 - the key",
      "hl": [
        "key"
      ],
      "mood": "neutral",
      "bg": "red",
      "pause": 0.22
    },
    {
      "text": "Google Maps and Firebase keys look exactly like it. And Google designed them to be public, right in your website's code.",
      "scene": "public_ok",
      "section": "02 - the key",
      "hl": [
        "public"
      ],
      "mood": "neutral",
      "gesture": "palm"
    },
    {
      "text": "Then Gemini showed up.",
      "scene": "flash",
      "section": "03 - the switch",
      "hl": [
        "Gemini"
      ],
      "mood": "smirk",
      "bg": "ink",
      "pause": 0.22
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn on the Gemini API in that same project, and the public key can now call Gemini. On your card.",
      "scene": "toggle",
      "section": "03 - the switch",
      "hl": [
        "Gemini",
        "card"
      ],
      "mood": "worried",
      "gesture": "point"
    },
    {
      "text": "Researchers found two thousand eight hundred and sixty-three of these keys, live, on public websites.",
      "scene": "counter",
      "section": "03 - the switch",
      "hl": [
        "live"
      ],
      "mood": "shocked"
    },
    {
      "text": "And new keys? Unrestricted by default.",
      "scene": "unrestricted",
      "section": "04 - the defaults",
      "hl": [
        "Unrestricted"
      ],
      "mood": "smirk",
      "gesture": "palm"
    },
    {
      "text": "Your spend cap won't save you either. Google's own docs say billing can lag about ten minutes, so you blow right past it.",
      "scene": "cap",
      "section": "04 - the defaults",
      "hl": [
        "cap",
        "ten",
        "past"
      ],
      "mood": "worried"
    },
    {
      "text": "On Supabase with row level security off? Anyone can read your users table. Over a hundred and seventy Lovable apps shipped like that.",
      "scene": "table",
      "section": "05 - the database",
      "hl": [
        "Anyone",
        "seventy"
      ],
      "mood": "neutral",
      "gesture": "point",
      "bg": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "And Google's answer to that eighty-two thousand dollar bill?",
      "scene": "support",
      "section": "06 - the answer",
      "hl": [
        "answer"
      ],
      "mood": "neutral",
      "pause": 0.22
    },
    {
      "text": "Shared responsibility.",
      "scene": "support",
      "section": "06 - the answer",
      "hl": [
        "responsibility"
      ],
      "mood": "smirk",
      "pause": 0.1
    },
    {
      "text": "Translation: it's your bill.",
      "scene": "support",
      "section": "06 - the answer",
      "hl": [
        "your",
        "bill"
      ],
      "mood": "smirk",
      "gesture": "palm",
      "pause": 0.22
    },
    {
      "text": "Send this video to Claude and ask it to lock down every key. Or copy the prompt from the caption.",
      "scene": "prompt_unlock",
      "section": "07 - the prompt",
      "hl": [
        "lock",
        "prompt"
      ],
      "mood": "happy",
      "gesture": "point"
    },
    {
      "text": "By the way, following me is cheaper than your next API bill.",
      "scene": "follow",
      "section": "07 - the prompt",
      "hl": [
        "cheaper"
      ],
      "mood": "happy",
